### Transaction Endpoints
### Run Login in auth.http first, then accounts.http to set accountId and toAccountNumber

# ─── Deposit ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "description": "Initial deposit"
}

### ─── Withdraw ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "amount": 150.00,
  "description": "ATM withdrawal"
}

### ─── Withdraw - insufficient funds (should return 422) ─────────────────────

POST http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "amount": 999999.00,
  "description": "This should fail"
}

### ─── Transfer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "toAccountNumber": "{{toAccountNumber}}",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "description": "Transfer to savings"
}

### ─── Transaction History - all ─────────────────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Transaction History - deposits only ───────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions?type=DEPOSIT
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Transaction History - withdrawals only ────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions?type=WITHDRAWAL
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Transaction History - transfers only ─────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions?type=TRANSFER_DEBIT
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Transaction History - date range ─────────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Transaction History - combined filters ────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions?type=DEPOSIT&from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
